  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place water and salt in a medium saucepan, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, wash, dry, trim, and peel carrots; coarsely grate."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop dates."
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the water is boiling, stir in carrots, dates, oats, and spices. Reduce heat to low, cover, and let simmer, stirring occasionally, until oatmeal reaches desired consistency, 3-5 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "While the oatmeal cooks, roughly chop walnuts."
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide oatmeal between bowls; top with walnuts and sprinkle with sugar. Serve with milk and enjoy!"
    }
  ]
